id: og_brickworks_c
name: Brickworks III
description: Brickworks. A clay pit open to the sky under a row of kilns that have no openings at all, both of them made of the same material and neither able to see the other. Built as a brick and tile works; a kiln was drawn early and the pit flooded the week after.

